                  %msub
                    %mi Ω
                    %mi x
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Omega_x X
            is equivalently the
            = succeed "-operation" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+topology"} string topology
